docs {
  # Cancel My Report (Protected)

  **Method:** `DELETE`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/reports/:id`
  **Auth:** Required (User Access Token)

  ## Description
  Allows the reporting user to cancel and withdraw their submitted report, provided it is still in `PENDING` status.

  ## Request

  ### Headers
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | Bearer access token (`Bearer <token>`) |

  ## Response
  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "message": "report cancelled successfully"
    }
  }
  ```
}
